message: If you use this code, please cite it using these metadata.
title: >-
  Analysis code for indirect reference intervals for 17 complete blood count
  parameters in an outpatient population in Uzbekistan
abstract: >-
  Extraction, quality-control and reference-interval estimation code for a
  12-month series of 30,512 validated outpatient complete blood counts from
  Tashkent, Uzbekistan. No patient data is included.
type: software
